      "title": "告警列表",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
      "description": "Grafana 当前活跃告警列表（需要在 Grafana Alerting 中配置告警规则）",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "alertInstanceLabelFilter": "",
        "alertName": "",
        "dashboardAlerts": false,
        "groupBy": ["grafana_folder", "alertname"],
        "groupMode": "default",
        "maxItems": 20,
        "sortOrder": 1,
        "stateFilter": {
          "error": true,
          "firing": true,
          "noData": false,
          "normal": false,
          "pending": true
        },
        "viewMode": "list"
      },
      "title": "当前活跃告警",
      "type": "alertlist"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "id": 102,
      "title": "需要关注的指标",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "description": "近 5 分钟错误日志的速率趋势",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "错误率 (logs/s)",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line+area" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "ERROR+CRITICAL 错误率" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "WARNING 速率" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "5 分钟错误率",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate({severity=~\"ERROR|CRITICAL\"} [5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ERROR+CRITICAL 错误率",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate({severity=\"WARNING\"} [5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "WARNING 速率",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
      "description": "近 5 分钟错误日志数量趋势",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "错误数",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line+area" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 10 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "CRITICAL" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "dark-red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "ERROR" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["sum", "max", "last"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "错误数趋势",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({severity=\"CRITICAL\"} [5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "CRITICAL",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "${DS_LOKI}" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({severity=\"ERROR\"} [5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ERROR",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "id": 103,
      "title": "告警规则建议",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
      "description": "推荐的 Grafana Alerting 告警规则配置指南",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## 📋 推荐告警规则配置\n\n在 **Grafana → Alerting → Alert rules** 中创建以下规则：\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 规则1：错误率过高 (CRITICAL)\n- **触发条件**：5 分钟内错误率超过 5%\n- **LogQL**：`sum(rate({severity=~\"ERROR|CRITICAL\"} [5m])) / sum(rate({severity=~\".+\"} [5m])) > 0.05`\n- **严重级别**：CRITICAL\n- **通知渠道**：钉钉 / 企业微信 / 邮件\n\n---\n\n### 🟠 规则2：错误数量过多 (ERROR)\n- **触发条件**：10 分钟内错误数超过 50 条\n- **LogQL**：`sum(count_over_time({severity=~\"ERROR|CRITICAL\"} [10m])) > 50`\n- **严重级别**：ERROR\n- **通知渠道**：钉钉 / 企业微信\n\n---\n\n### 🟡 规则3：警告数量过多 (WARNING)\n- **触发条件**：15 分钟内警告数超过 100 条\n- **LogQL**：`sum(count_over_time({severity=\"WARNING\"} [15m])) > 100`\n- **严重级别**：WARNING\n- **通知渠道**：邮件\n\n---\n\n### 🚨 规则4：出现 CRITICAL 日志（立即告警）\n- **触发条件**：任何 CRITICAL 级别日志出现\n- **LogQL**：`sum(count_over_time({severity=\"CRITICAL\"} [1m])) > 0`\n- **严重级别**：CRITICAL\n- **通知渠道**：钉钉 + 电话告警\n\n---\n\n> 💡 **提示**：在 Grafana Alerting 中，Loki 告警规则需要使用 **Metric 查询**（即返回数值的 LogQL），而不是日志流查询。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "告警规则配置指南",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["loki", "告警"],
